      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呜呜呜……训练员！\n呜哇哇哇……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d5c4bbf63d921dd2222a9e74b55fd922e0c5d3b58d737e28cac41c44a7d4d56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21103e98e78d5aa3bc08f6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为领队的职责，还有她自己想赢得『天皇赏』的心情……\n对背负着这两点奔跑的目白麦昆，我只能表达感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2f89a99120db1dcbe9176ad9586f31f77ffc511a963ec6f36cd4a755c2a774",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36505bc167861bc18f9e6d63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这点也一定传达给了米浴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "389a637c6236d7415bdaf62cca9c29dac84060475a03e8d4a927bb19d7d852c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
