        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1608dfb17f66193131904f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴",
      "source_fingerprint": "d99d52ed25db0eb937105063cfedfb65e5d199dc54c299f063e87411d9cb2f20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac46a5ee67edb57b05873ba1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿……大家都很失望呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d3c598688a08c33ae5b22ae6cff9fcdd8951ef66ebfa05a3c94c3a3e3ebc139",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca8d5f3c209e33009370995",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "孤身一人的魔法使。\n某一天，一个小男孩来拜访她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bbe64edc9bcc5092e862f2b055099a39d3a0c386f5298ad1e0f18bbbcf8257d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ec3bbf1eb30b0c5770746d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『我想像小鸟一样在天上飞』",
      "source_fingerprint": "c88d836a4de4455cd70f8a7e61abe7d516cdd954fcb904b1a054fce675087ef6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e251924cffecc92cc4b414",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "魔法使很开心地用了魔法，实现了愿望的男孩\n露出了笑容。『哇！　好厉害好厉害！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "074bd63844bbe505481b9e24445f7dfb1b603e5e750b32e369dc85cfc7ee15c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a4769e052060aba6c98c100",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，知道了这件事的人们\n都来到了魔法使身边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c24380f66d022c215299f48d5ea700253cc4382080d055ad30968d781075da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeb0ed7ebff3dee2b389aea2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然还有害怕的人，\n但魔法使身边的笑容逐渐变多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eabd462e056efcbfa64b4edf1174e2fb0d9584e815e637aa070589b387b874e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbca956eb17be927c61256b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "魔法使想让大家幸福，\n她尽自己最大力量，使用了很多魔法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "515ef84c8dc20d51c2dc5d66b52499c88e35f40c90fcabed06b99b264cfcba31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f690d2f7c53a366a69edc266",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——但是突然，\n她变得无法再使用魔法了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bedfc027a4519824e986190af13617d60a1de1c476cf8894d1a76ef485dc17a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        56,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/56/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:152926d38e24770d7a75545f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为之前用了太多魔法，她累倒了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e55580dbe263b33ce24c0c282a77660a2e458bd125031500b31c69af311adaec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae422151a5582d97394135fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之前害怕魔法使的人们，\n知道了魔法使是想让人们变得幸福才这么努力，",
      "source_fingerprint": "8252ce7d2019d2ee42e0491476c6a1072a78863e6d20f0dca02860357fce2e60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c3ccdce4a58c72ab62b002d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "了解了魔法使真实的想法之后，\n他们都来看望魔法使。",
      "source_fingerprint": "689de6c2dd250a8fbe5e214e193fccd8f5d74da2a308b4ab678b101f9b3abcaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d993878911da9de9f4d2fab1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴",
