    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609ac6c8c639f990f2b03e2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然麦昆同学说有想让我看到的“景色”，\n但好像跟『菊花赏』那时差不多……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e583d8c5ef1067112608f8bd5d721bd8d4a8c7432ad526dff38aed3c68447a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
