      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我当然也知道会变成这样……\n但果然还是……有些伤心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "89a2821f32fbf9f9ad7f27ee40fef03bdd66d2b664b8cb4cb605adfd951fb572",
